{"events":[{"i":0,"year":218,"type":"founding","actors":[{"kind":"realm","id":0}],"loc":10689,"text":"The Clawcrag Empire rose from the Lionkin (Catfolk) heartland, and its word became law"},{"i":1,"year":220,"type":"goldenAge","actors":[{"kind":"realm","id":0}],"text":"The Clawcrag Empire reached the height of its power and learning"},{"i":2,"year":223,"type":"migration","actors":[{"kind":"realm","id":0},{"kind":"culture","id":0}],"text":"Pockets of Wildlands speakers endure in the old Clawcrag Empire heartland, relics of imperial resettlement"},{"i":3,"year":224,"type":"battle","actors":[{"kind":"realm","id":0},{"kind":"state","id":9},{"kind":"state","id":0}],"loc":4923,"text":"The armies of the Clawcrag Empire met their enemies in the field one final time, and broke"},{"i":4,"year":224,"type":"collapse","actors":[{"kind":"realm","id":0},{"kind":"state","id":9},{"kind":"state","id":0},{"kind":"state","id":58},{"kind":"state","id":67}],"text":"In 224 the Clawcrag Empire fell to ruin; Ferfoldia, the wild tribes, Srath and Fruict rose from its remains"},{"i":5,"year":226,"type":"founding","actors":[{"kind":"state","id":58}],"text":"Lizardfolk settlers proclaimed the Srath Empire"},{"i":6,"year":226,"type":"coronation","actors":[{"kind":"figure","id":3},{"kind":"state","id":58}],"text":"Eshjugash was crowned Empress of Srath"},{"i":7,"year":299,"type":"schism","actors":[{"kind":"religion","id":46},{"kind":"religion","id":2}],"text":"The Imperial (Human)ism faith was organized from the Old Coviumism tradition"},{"i":8,"year":327,"type":"schism","actors":[{"kind":"religion","id":45},{"kind":"religion","id":35}],"text":"The Dha'kazath'vism faith was organized from the Mindflayer (Eldritch) Beliefs tradition"},{"i":9,"year":557,"type":"succession","actors":[{"kind":"figure","id":4},{"kind":"figure","id":3},{"kind":"state","id":58}],"text":"Eshjugash was laid to rest, and Shegakrus inherited the throne of Srath"},{"i":10,"year":567,"type":"founding","actors":[{"kind":"stat